\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  Come to Jesus, all ye sinners,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 This is your salvation now
\par Jesus wants to deliver you
\par He is ever merciful
\par He can; and so all to him come,
\par do not hesitate to come.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  All you people who are thirsty
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 come and take God's mercy now
\par come with faith and true repentance
\par and His mercies that draws near
\par Even gold can never buy it
\par Jesus will give you for free.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.   Do not ever remember sin
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  but to dream about goodness.
\par  All the good things that He want is
\par  to know your sin and repent
\par  He will give to you a new life
\par  and His spirit too someday.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Look, the Saviour is in Heaven
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  in His blood we have been saved
\par  Everlasting peace and mercy
\par  He gave to all believers
\par  If one turns away from one's sins
\par  Heaven becomes full of Joy.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

